'''SnowflakeKiwi''' is an [[NPC]] in the {{zone|Prison of the Bereft}} based on a streamer with the same name.

'''SnowflakeKiwi''' was elected as a [[Minister Election|Minister]] to {{NPCSprite|Candidate Aura;Aura}}. When she won, she attempted to remove the {{AN|Work Smarter}} perk and was sent to the {{zone|Prison of the Bereft}}. While imprisoned, she walks around the cage and sends messages in chat.

